@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR

Class UniqueStudentList
Class Student
Class Address
Class Email
Class Name
Class Phone
Class "{abstract}\n Tag" as Tag
Class StudentTag
Class WorkoutPlansList
Class WorkoutPlan

UniqueStudentList --> "*" Student
Student --> "1" Name
Student --> "1" Phone
Student --> "1" Email
Student --> "1" Address
Student --> "*" StudentTag
Student --> "1" WorkoutPlansList
WorkoutPlansList --> "*" WorkoutPlan

note right of WorkoutPlan
  Details of WorkoutPlan are omitted for clarity.
end note

StudentTag --|> Tag

Name -[hidden]right-> Phone
Phone -[hidden]right-> Address
Address -[hidden]right-> WorkoutPlansList
WorkoutPlansList -[hidden]right-> Email
@enduml
